# local build dependency, not game content
*.tmp
*.user
.godot/
bin/
obj/
typecheck/GodotSharp.dll
typecheck/GodotSharpEditor.dll

# Per-machine paths (where Godot lives). Gitignored on purpose: it is about this computer,
# not about the game. tools/find-godot.ps1 reads it; see docs/README.md.
local.config.ps1

# Godot import output, regenerated on the first open after extracting. The project is
# developed in a sandbox with no editor, so these never existed here until it was opened
# on Windows. Checked before ignoring: no .tscn references a generated uid:// (the one
# uid in MainMenu.tscn is hand-written), so nothing breaks when they are regenerated.
*.import
*.uid
